[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5387838031","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122736#issuecomment-5387838031","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122736","id":5387838031,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQSPiTw","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-23T18:48:28Z","updated_at":"2026-08-23T18:48:28Z","body":"> Good point. Maybe the order in which this happens could be changed, if possible?\r\n\r\nThe only way to detect language change is either NOTIFICATION_TRANSLATION_CHANGED or the unexposed `_translation_changed` signal. The former depends on tree order, so it can't be really fixed, the latter would need to be exposed, but either way it happens after notification, so still problematic. Though propagating notification again is not really a problem if you propagate it only to controls (docks) from your plugin.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5387838031/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confu